{"id": "EUVD-2026-80420", "enisaUuid": "0cff99c1-9879-382b-b075-c09990a06ffd", "description": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\ndrm/amd/display: fix dc_lock leak on GPU reset error paths\n\nOn GPU reset, dm_suspend() takes dc_lock and leaves it for dm_resume()\nto drop. If amdgpu_dm_commit_zero_streams() or dm_dmub_hw_init() fails,\nthe function returns with the lock still held. The matching resume path\nis then skipped, so every later dc_lock take hangs.\n\nRelease the cached DC state and unlock before returning the error.", "datePublished": "2026-09-16T10:30:52", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-19T08:53:14", "baseScore": 0.0, "references": ["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/295d2bf42061db490254e748f9344545bb7faf19", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/dac29cbb405b912742f4f7eda833cec8e7a53780", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/92a9eebd2a1f892fe482154d83f9f1626bc73d3b"], "aliases": ["GHSA-3jx4-mfrm-mq9q", "CVE-2026-89820"], "assigner": "Linux", "epss": 0.21, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "0c2a7dd0-7c55-3978-997a-cf91e7594309", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "3cf7a0bc87f028b6bc63a43a80d9d6026ae4d85f <92a9eebd2a1f892fe482154d83f9f1626bc73d3b"}, {"id": "142dd472-7a0c-30a5-b1fc-49cfa94d35bf", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 7.2.5"}, {"id": "534339a0-5926-394a-9740-a375d3e20688", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "6.15"}, {"id": "569bf1ae-ca45-3f1a-b382-4bde0171b48f", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "3cf7a0bc87f028b6bc63a43a80d9d6026ae4d85f <295d2bf42061db490254e748f9344545bb7faf19"}, {"id": "5957ccc7-9883-3460-960b-61fe80686452", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 7.3"}, {"id": "97d9615b-8b69-363f-a9e8-ad4baf82c5af", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 0"}, {"id": "e17dff38-c60e-362c-b88c-ca25ef712516", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "3cf7a0bc87f028b6bc63a43a80d9d6026ae4d85f <dac29cbb405b912742f4f7eda833cec8e7a53780"}, {"id": "e96adc86-b917-3832-ab31-df954815a1ca", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 6.18.51"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "9678ac83-910a-3623-9f47-6264611278cf", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}], "isExploited": false}